   audit directly) -- that one is fine in-container.\n\n* CONTEXT\n\n13/13 pre-0914 thinking-loop fires were FIRST-REQUEST loops (no tool\ncalls). The 09-14 fire was the first MID-CYCLE one. Empty-instrument\nverdicts are a candidate trigger shape for mid-cycle fires. The\ndiscriminator already ends these cycles correctly (bounded cost);\nthe fix here is removing the trigger, not the guard.\n[t+02:24/60:00 c16/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_592zzqme","function":{"index":0,"name":"list_directory","arguments":{"path":"/root/i.ar"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[15:30:49] .git/\n.gitignore\nGUIDELINES.org\nHISTORY.log\nLICENSE\nREADME.org\naudit/\ncontainers/\nemacs.d/\nmetaconfig/\nprompts/\ntest/\nutils/\n[t+02:39/60:00 c17/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_tpemyimo","function":{"index":0,"name":"list_directory","arguments":{"path":"/root/i.ar"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[15:30:54] .git/\n.gitignore\nGUIDELINES.org\nHISTORY.log\nLICENSE\nREADME.org\naudit/\ncontainers/\nemacs.d/\nmetaconfig/\nprompts/\ntest/\nutils/\n[t+02:45/60:00 c18/300]"}]
